## 3. Contributor License Agreement (CLA) for Contributions

By submitting a Pull Request (PR) or contributing code, assets, or localization files to this repository, you agree that:
1. **Source Code Contributions:** All submitted code will be licensed under the project's **GNU GPLv3** license.
2. **Visual & Asset Contributions:** Any visual assets submitted via PR will be assigned/licensed to the project author (**SilverBreezed**). The author retains the exclusive right to distribute, modify, and include these assets in official releases under the All Rights Reserved model.
